@startuml
title CEMS Sequence Diagram - Event Approval

actor Organizer
actor Administrator
participant "React Frontend" as FE
participant "Express API" as API
participant "Auth/RBAC Middleware" as AUTH
participant "Event / Approval Service" as SERVICE
database MongoDB as DB
participant "Notification Service" as NOTIFY

Organizer -> FE : Create/edit event
FE -> API : POST /api/events
API -> AUTH : Verify Organizer
AUTH --> API : Authorized
API -> SERVICE : Validate and submit
SERVICE -> DB : Save event as Pending Approval
DB --> SERVICE : Saved
SERVICE --> API : Pending status
API --> FE : Submission confirmation
FE --> Organizer : Event submitted

Administrator -> FE : View pending events
FE -> API : GET /api/admin/events/pending
API -> AUTH : Verify Administrator
AUTH --> API : Authorized
API -> SERVICE : Fetch pending events
SERVICE -> DB : Query pending events
DB --> SERVICE : Pending events
SERVICE --> API : Pending events
API --> FE : JSON list
FE --> Administrator : Display queue

Administrator -> FE : Approve / Reject / Request Changes
FE -> API : Submit decision
API -> AUTH : Verify Administrator
AUTH --> API : Authorized
API -> SERVICE : Process decision
SERVICE -> DB : Update event status and audit record
DB --> SERVICE : Updated
SERVICE -> NOTIFY : Notify Organizer
NOTIFY --> Organizer : Approval decision
SERVICE --> API : Decision result
API --> FE : JSON response
FE --> Administrator : Display result

@enduml
